===Etymology===
From {{term|Ost|lang=de}} or {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|ostan|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*austą}}, related to {{term/t|ine-pro|*ausos||dawn}}, compare {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|aurora|lang=la}}, and {{etyl|la|-}} {{term|auster|lang=la}}, which, probably due to a re-orientation, means "South".

